				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13893057</guid>
				<title>Unbearable Hope</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13893057/unbearable-hope</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Dec 2020 23:42:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MalyceGraves</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4916887</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="border:solid 1px #000000; color:#6e6e6e; border-radius: 10px; background:#16002b; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding:10px"> <p><em>“The worst part of holding the memories is not the pain. It's the loneliness of it. Memories need to be shared.”</em><br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>- Lois Lowry, <em>The Giver</em></p> </div> </div> <p>So we step into Nadox for a time and catch a glimpse of the unbearable loneliness he's endured in order to perfect his <em>niŋä's</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-661714-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> Great Plan. Through that, we also must wonder what Ion themself endured.</p> <p>Many thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span>, for his critique and support throughout this project. Without it, I doubt Memoria would ever even exist. Unlike Nadox, I know that I am not doing this alone.</p> <p>Critters: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" >cybersqyd</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span>, &amp; <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oricat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5199638&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952597" alt="OriCat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5199638)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oricat" >OriCat</a></span>. Thank you all, you are also instrumental to making this work.</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-661714-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Spouse</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
